{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"BOLD Portal","version":"0.1.0"},"paths":{"/api/query":{"get":{"tags":["query"],"summary":"Query Records","description":"A query endpoint to retrieve records from \"triplet\" search terms. Scopes are `tax`, `geo`, `ids`, `bin`, and `recordsetcode`.\nThis queries the DB and saves the results to a tmp location, then it returns the `query_id` to the user.\n\n- **query**: A semicolon delimited set of \"triplet\" tokens. The format for each triplet is [scope]:[subscope]:[value]\n- **extent**: Set the number of document IDs to fetch (zero = 0 (query not run), full = all, others mappings found in `EXTENT_MAP`)","operationId":"query_records_api_query_get","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":250,"title":"Query"}},{"name":"extent","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"(zero|limited|large|full)","title":"Document extent","default":"limited"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Query Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/QueryResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/query/parse":{"get":{"tags":["query"],"summary":"Query Terms Parsing","description":"A service that accepts a free text query string and parse it into a semicolon separated list of triplets of\nsearch terms in the following format `<scope>:<rank>:<term>`.\n\n- **query**: String where multiple search terms are separated by space with the optional scope specified as *[scope]* after a term.\n             Double quote (\") must be used to specify multi-word search term. Single quote can be used as part of a word/phrase.\n             Example) `Ontario \"Homo sapiens\" [tax]` will be parsed into `tax:na:Homo sapiens;na:na:Ontario`","operationId":"query_terms_parsing_api_query_parse_get","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Query"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Query Parse Results","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/QueryParseResults"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/query/preprocessor":{"get":{"tags":["query"],"summary":"Resolve Query","description":"Processes and resolves query tokens if matches are found. If matches are not found, will attempt\nto infer possible values for the intended search and return successfully. If triplet token cannot\nbe resolved unambiguously, will return possible values but return as an error. If no tokens are\nprocessed, will also return an error.\n\n- **query**: A semicolon delimited set of \"triplet\" tokens. The format for each triplet is\n             [scope]:[subscope]:[value], but can also accept \"doublet\" ([scope]:[value]) and\n             \"singleton\" ([value]) tokens.","operationId":"resolve_query_api_query_preprocessor_get","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":250,"title":"Query"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Query Preprocessing","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/QueryPreprocessorSuccess"}}}},"400":{"description":"Failed Query Preprocessing","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/QueryPreprocessorFail"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/terms":{"get":{"tags":["terms"],"summary":"Fetch Term Hits","description":"Return top X terms that match the supplied partial term at the start of the term.\nThis is analagous to `^{partial_term}.*` in regex. Terms are standardized to optimize\ncreating matches easily with proxy characters.\n\n- **partial_term**: Start of term to search for","operationId":"fetch_term_hits_api_terms_get","parameters":[{"name":"partial_term","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Partial term"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Limit # of hits to return","default":20}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Matching list of terms","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/summary":{"get":{"tags":["summary"],"summary":"Generate Metadata Summary","description":"Generate metadata summary by way of aggregating fields requested fields from documents selected by\na query. For each field, will aggregate data into unique values and their frequencies. Can apply\nadditional reduce operations to condense response.\n\n- **query**: A semicolon delimited set of \"triplet\" tokens. The format for each triplet is [scope]:[subscope]:[value]\n- **fields**: Field(s) to extract and aggregate, as CSV\n- **reduce**: Field(s) to perform an additional reduction on, as CSV (excluding `counts`)\n- **reduce_operation**: Type of reduce, options include: `count` (sum of all values in aggregates),\n                        `unique` (number of unique entities in field)","operationId":"generate_metadata_summary_api_summary_get","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":250,"title":"Triplets query"}},{"name":"fields","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Fields to query as CSV"}},{"name":"reduce","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Fields to reduce as CSV","default":""}},{"name":"reduce_operation","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"(count|unique)","title":"Reduce operation","default":"count"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Metadata Summary","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"integer"}},{"type":"integer"}]},"title":"Response Generate Metadata Summary Api Summary Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{query_id}":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Retrieve Documents","description":"Retrieve a set of documents IDs from an encoded query (query_id) and fetch a set\nof documents of `length` size after `start` offset. If request size exceeds number of\ndocuments available after offset, will return documents with size less than requested.\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`\n- **length**: Number of documents to retrieve (minimum 0)\n- **start**: Offset of documents from beginning of documents in query (minimum 0)","operationId":"retrieve_documents_api_documents__query_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}},{"name":"length","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"title":"Documents limit","default":1}},{"name":"start","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"title":"Documents offset","default":0}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Document Set, Tailored For DataTables","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Documents"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{query_id}/query":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Retrieve Documents Query","description":"Retrieve the original query from an encoded query (query_id)\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`","operationId":"retrieve_documents_query_api_documents__query_id__query_get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Original Query Tokens","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{},"title":"Response Retrieve Documents Query Api Documents  Query Id  Query Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{query_id}/download":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Retrieve Documents Download","description":"Generate a download file with documents from an encoded query (query_id). Will download up to a\nmaximum of `DL_MAX_SIZE` documents for a given query and will ignore the query extent to always\ndownload the full extent.\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`\n- **format**: Export format, available options are `dwc` (Darwin Core Model), `tsv` and `json` (as JSON lines)\n- **fields**: BCDM fields to retrieve as CSV (other fields will be filtered from export)","operationId":"retrieve_documents_download_api_documents__query_id__download_get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"(dwc|tsv|json)","title":"Download format","default":"json"}},{"name":"fields","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Fields to retrieve","default":""}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Document Export","content":{"text/plain":{},"text/tab-separated-values":{}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/ancillary":{"get":{"tags":["ancillary"],"summary":"Retrieve Ancillary Documents","description":"Retrieve ancillary documents from a collection. Designate a key field to match value(s) against\nto select a set of documents from the specified collection. If a collection that does not exist\nis specified or no documents with the selected key matches the value(s) no documents are returned.\n\n- **collection**: Collection name to retrieve from\n- **key**: Field to query within documents of collection\n- **values**: Values to match to key within document, as semicolon delimited values\n- **fields**: Fields to select, as semicolon delimited values","operationId":"retrieve_ancillary_documents_api_ancillary_get","parameters":[{"name":"collection","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Collection name to retrieve from"}},{"name":"key","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Field to query"}},{"name":"values","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Values to match, as semicolon delimited values"}},{"name":"fields","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Fields to select, as semicolon delimited values"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Document List","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"title":"Response Retrieve Ancillary Documents Api Ancillary Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/ancillary-set":{"get":{"tags":["ancillary"],"summary":"Retrieve Ancillary Documents Set","description":"Retrieve the entire set of ancillary documents from a collection.\n\n- **collection**: Collection name to retrieve from\n- **fields**: Fields to select, as semicolon delimited values\n- **min_records**: Minimum # of records associated with registry entry","operationId":"retrieve_ancillary_documents_set_api_ancillary_set_get","parameters":[{"name":"collection","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Collection name to retrieve from"}},{"name":"fields","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Fields to select, as semicolon delimited values"}},{"name":"min_records","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"title":"Minimum # of records associated with registry entry","default":0}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Document List for DataTables","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"title":"Response Retrieve Ancillary Documents Set Api Ancillary Set Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/maps/{query_id}":{"get":{"tags":["maps"],"summary":"Generate Map","description":"Generate a map of collection locations from an encoded query (query_id).\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`\n- **offset**: Integer offset to emphasize markers\n- **countryIso**: ISO alpha2 country code to crop and zoom map into","operationId":"generate_map_api_maps__query_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"title":"Count offset, for additional visual clarity)","default":0}},{"name":"countryIso","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Country map to zoom into (by ISO code)"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Map Image","content":{"image/png":{}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/counts":{"get":{"tags":["counts"],"summary":"Generate Metadata Counts","description":"Return simple metadata count statistics for a query in triplets form. If multiple terms are specified\nand matched, will combine and add results together.\n\n- **query**: A semicolon delimited set of \"triplet\" tokens. The format for each triplet is [scope]:[subscope]:[value]","operationId":"generate_metadata_counts_api_counts_get","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":250,"title":"Triplets query"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Metadata Counts","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MetadataCounts"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/stats":{"get":{"tags":["stats"],"summary":"Retrieve General Stats","description":"Return a general statistic about the overall database.\n\n- **stat**: Stat to return","operationId":"retrieve_general_stats_api_stats_get","parameters":[{"name":"stat","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Stat to retrieve"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"General Statistics","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"integer"},"title":"Response Retrieve General Stats Api Stats Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/images":{"get":{"tags":["images"],"summary":"Generate Image Set","description":"Retrieve a set of image metadata and image URLs from a set of CAOS IDs.\n\n- **ids**: List of CAOS IDs as a CSV","operationId":"generate_image_set_api_images_get","parameters":[{"name":"ids","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"CSV of CAOS IDs"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Image Metadata Set","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ImageSummary"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/images/{query_id}":{"get":{"tags":["images"],"summary":"Generate Images Summary","description":"Retrieve a set of image metadata and image URLs from an encoded query (query_id). Selects a random\nset of `IMG_LIMIT` images from querying a random set of process IDs (maximum `IMG_PID_LIMIT`) to CAOS.\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`\n- **max_images**: Maximum number of images returned, set to `IMG_LIMIT` if max_images < 0","operationId":"generate_images_summary_api_images__query_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}},{"name":"max_images","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Maximum # of images","default":-1}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Image Metadata Summary","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ImageSummary"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/taxonomy/description":{"get":{"tags":["taxonomy"],"summary":"Retrieve Taxonomy Description","description":"Retrieve a taxonomy description from BOLD as a proxy endpoint.\n\n- **name**: Taxonomy name\n- **rank**: Taxonomy rank","operationId":"retrieve_taxonomy_description_api_taxonomy_description_get","parameters":[{"name":"name","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Taxonomy Name"}},{"name":"rank","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Taxonomy Rank"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Taxonomy Description","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxonomyDescription"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/taxonomy/hierarchy":{"get":{"tags":["taxonomy"],"summary":"Retrieve Taxonomy Hierarchy","description":"Generate a taxonomy hierarchy based on taxonomy name and rank.\nReturns a frequency of taxonomy names found in query by rank across\nthe hierarchy, from all rank levels higher than the current rank\nup to the next immediate rank.\n\n- **name**: Taxonomy name\n- **rank**: Taxonomy rank","operationId":"retrieve_taxonomy_hierarchy_api_taxonomy_hierarchy_get","parameters":[{"name":"name","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Taxonomy Name"}},{"name":"rank","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Taxonomy Rank"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Taxonomy Hierarchy","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxonomyHierarchySummary"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/taxonomy/{query_id}":{"get":{"tags":["taxonomy"],"summary":"Generate Taxonomy Summary","description":"Generate a taxonomy summary from an encoded query (`query_id`).\nReturns a frequency of taxonomy names found in query by rank.\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`","operationId":"generate_taxonomy_summary_api_taxonomy__query_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Taxonomy Summary","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxonomySummary"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/taxonomy/{query_id}/map":{"get":{"tags":["taxonomy"],"summary":"Generate Taxonomy Map Summary","description":"Generate a taxonomy tree map from an encoded query (`query_id`).\nReturns a mapping of child-parent relations and frequency of taxonomy names\nfound in query by rank. If one or more kingdoms' frequencies exceed the\nfractional threshold of `TAX_THRESHOLD`, other kingdoms not meeting the threshold\nwill be omitted from the result.\n\n- **query_id**: Encoded triplets query from `/api/query`\n- **node_threshold**: Threshold to limit cumulative node count descending\n                      through taxonomy ranks","operationId":"generate_taxonomy_map_summary_api_taxonomy__query_id__map_get","parameters":[{"name":"query_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Documents query ID"}},{"name":"node_threshold","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Node threshold where child ranks are omitted","default":1000}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Taxonomy Map Summary","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxonomyMapSummary"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/qr-code/sequence":{"get":{"tags":["qr"],"summary":"Generate Sequence Qr Code","description":"Generate a QR code of the given sequence.\n\n- **sequence**: Sequence string.","operationId":"generate_sequence_qr_code_api_qr_code_sequence_get","parameters":[{"name":"sequence","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Sequence to translate"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Sequence QR Image","content":{"image/jpeg":{}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/qr-code/record":{"get":{"tags":["qr"],"summary":"Generate Record Qr Code","description":"Generate a QR code of the given record based on processid.\n\n- **processid**: Process ID string.","operationId":"generate_record_qr_code_api_qr_code_record_get","parameters":[{"name":"processid","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Process ID of the record"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Record QR Image","content":{"image/jpeg":{}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"CopyrightDetails":{"properties":{"holder":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Holder"},"year":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Year"},"license":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"License"},"institution":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Institution"}},"type":"object","required":["holder","year","license","institution"],"title":"CopyrightDetails"},"Documents":{"properties":{"data":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Data"},"recordsTotal":{"type":"integer","title":"Recordstotal"},"recordsFiltered":{"type":"integer","title":"Recordsfiltered"}},"type":"object","required":["data","recordsTotal","recordsFiltered"],"title":"Documents"},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"ImageMetadata":{"properties":{"image_url":{"type":"string","title":"Image Url"},"thumbnail_url":{"type":"string","title":"Thumbnail Url"},"object_id":{"type":"string","title":"Object Id"},"batch":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Batch"},"file_name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"File Name"},"processid":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Processid"},"sampleid":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Sampleid"},"meta":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Meta"},"copyright":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CopyrightDetails"},"photographer":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Photographer"},"bin_uri":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Bin Uri"},"inst":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Inst"},"identification":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Identification"},"identified_by":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Identified By"},"collectors":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Collectors"},"country/ocean":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Country/Ocean"}},"type":"object","required":["image_url","thumbnail_url","object_id","batch","file_name","processid","sampleid","meta","copyright","photographer","bin_uri","inst","identification","identified_by","collectors"],"title":"ImageMetadata"},"ImageSummary":{"properties":{"images":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ImageMetadata"},"type":"array","title":"Images"},"photographers":{"additionalProperties":{"type":"integer"},"type":"object","title":"Photographers"}},"type":"object","required":["images","photographers"],"title":"ImageSummary"},"MetadataCounts":{"properties":{"records":{"type":"integer","title":"Records"},"summaries":{"type":"integer","title":"Summaries"}},"type":"object","required":["records","summaries"],"title":"MetadataCounts"},"QueryParseResults":{"properties":{"terms":{"type":"string","title":"Terms"},"ignored_terms":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Ignored Terms"}},"type":"object","required":["terms","ignored_terms"],"title":"QueryParseResults"},"QueryPreprocessorFail":{"properties":{"successful_terms":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TermMatch"},"type":"array","title":"Successful Terms"},"failed_terms":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TermMatch"},"type":"array","title":"Failed Terms"}},"type":"object","required":["successful_terms","failed_terms"],"title":"QueryPreprocessorFail"},"QueryPreprocessorSuccess":{"properties":{"successful_terms":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TermMatch"},"type":"array","title":"Successful Terms"}},"type":"object","required":["successful_terms"],"title":"QueryPreprocessorSuccess"},"QueryResponse":{"properties":{"query_id":{"type":"string","title":"Query Id"},"extent_limit":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Extent Limit"}},"type":"object","required":["query_id","extent_limit"],"title":"QueryResponse"},"TaxonomyDescription":{"properties":{"text":{"type":"string","title":"Text"},"url":{"type":"string","title":"Url"}},"type":"object","required":["text","url"],"title":"TaxonomyDescription"},"TaxonomyHierarchySummary":{"properties":{"phylum":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Phylum"},"class":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Class"},"order":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Order"},"family":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Family"},"subfamily":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Subfamily"},"tribe":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Tribe"},"genus":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Genus"},"species":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Species"},"subspecies":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Subspecies"}},"type":"object","required":["phylum","class","order","family","subfamily","tribe","genus","species","subspecies"],"title":"TaxonomyHierarchySummary"},"TaxonomyMapSummary":{"properties":{"taxonomy_lineage":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Taxonomy Lineage"},"taxonomy":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxonomyRankSummary"}},"type":"object","required":["taxonomy_lineage","taxonomy"],"title":"TaxonomyMapSummary"},"TaxonomyRankSummary":{"properties":{"kingdom":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Kingdom"},"phylum":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Phylum"},"class":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Class"},"order":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Order"},"family":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Family"},"subfamily":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Subfamily"},"tribe":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Tribe"},"genus":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Genus"},"species":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Species"},"subspecies":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Subspecies"}},"type":"object","required":["kingdom","phylum","class","order","family","subfamily","tribe","genus","species","subspecies"],"title":"TaxonomyRankSummary"},"TaxonomySummary":{"properties":{"taxonomy":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxonomyRankSummary"}},"type":"object","required":["taxonomy"],"title":"TaxonomySummary"},"TermMatch":{"properties":{"submitted":{"type":"string","title":"Submitted"},"matched":{"type":"string","title":"Matched"}},"type":"object","required":["submitted","matched"],"title":"TermMatch"},"ValidationError":{"properties":{"loc":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}]},"type":"array","title":"Location"},"msg":{"type":"string","title":"Message"},"type":{"type":"string","title":"Error Type"}},"type":"object","required":["loc","msg","type"],"title":"ValidationError"}}}}